  "priorExpiration": "2018-12-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ve-H 303.01 Medical Eligibility Standard. A veteran shall meet the medical eligibility standard if he or she is incapable of earning a living because of age, disease, or infirmity.\n\nSource. #8953, eff 7-21-07, EXPIRED: 7-21-15\n\nNew. #12564, INTERIM, eff 6-28-18, EXPIRED: 12-26-18\n\nNew. #12712, eff 1-15-19",
